      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
    )
    (property "Note" "MATCHED to the other leg. Three jobs at once: it limits clamp-diode current on a 20 V signal (3.4 mA) and on a 40 V overspeed one (7.7 mA), it is the R of the input filter, and it is most of the Rth that sets the hysteresis window. The block used 1k because none of those three exist in an ideal-switch model." (id 5) (at 85.0 70.0 0)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
    )
