    (property "Note" "3.3 V * 4489 / (4489 + 33000) = 0.395 V, i.e. +/-198 mV, against the +/-200 mV the block modelled. Positive feedback to IN+, not IN- -- to IN- it is negative feedback and the comparator oscillates at every crossing instead of snapping through it." (id 5) (at 250.0 48.0 0)
